Error [jet.NameAlreadyTaken]: The name `io` is already taken here
  --> tests/ui/template_local_hides_use_or_prelude_name.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |             io: target.name
    |             ^^
 Why: `io` is a `use` name of this file; a template's own local may not hide it, so the template's code means the same at every marker
 Fix: Pick a different name for the template's local
